osed Fridays. Marriage licenses are available from 8:00AM to 4:00PM.  \r\n9 \n2 \n2 \n3 \t\t\nGeneral Resources \n\t\t\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registrations \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t New Vehicle Registrations \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Vehicle Registration Renewals \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Online Registration Renewals \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Residency Requirements \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Titles and Plates \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t OHRV and Boat Registrations \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Vehicle Registration Tax Deduction \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Address Change \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Election and Voter Information \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t General Information \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Voter Information \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Election Laws and Ordinances \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Election Results \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Vital Records  \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Requesting Vital Records \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Applying for A Marriage License \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Notary Services \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Tax Collections \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Tax Bills and Information \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Tax Rate Explained \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t New Hampshire Assessing Reference Manual \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Tax Bill Online \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Registering Your Dog \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Top Dog Contest \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Boards & Committees \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Boards, Committees, & Commissions \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Agendas, Minutes, and Audio  \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t City Meeting Calendar \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Board Member Application \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Additional Resources \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Frequently Asked Questions \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t New Residents to Lebanon \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Meet the Staff \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Organizational Chart \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\nNews & Announcements \r\n\t General Election is Tuesday, November 3  \r\nNew Hampshire’s General Election is Tuesday, November 3. Polls are open from 7:00am to 7:00pm. Visit the City Clerk's Office to register to vote or to request an absentee ballot.\t\t\t\t Vote on Tuesday, November 3. \r\n\t 53 Ways to Get Involved!  \r\nLebanon has 53 vacant seats on City boards, committees, and commissions. Explore opportunities to serve, including openings with UVLSRPC, and take an active role in the community. Find what interests you and apply!\t\t\t\t Apply Today!  \r\n\t Pawsitively #1: Lebanon’s 2026 Top Dog!  \r\nMeet the 2026 Top Dogs! All pups licensed by April 30 were entered to win, and at the June 17 City Council meeting, Mayor Whittlesey proudly drew the lucky winners.\r\nCongratulations, Ivy, Marley, and Booger!\t\t\t\t Meet Lebanon's Top Dog. \r\n\t State of NH Budget Passes with New Motor Vehicle Fee Schedule  \r\nThe State of New Hampshire has officially passed its biennial budget, and included in that legislation is a new statewide motor vehicle fee schedule that will take effect January 1, 2026.\t\t\t\t State Motor Vehicle Registration Fees Increasing. \r\n\t Plan Ahead: NH DMV Requires Appointments for All Services  \r\nStarting Monday, November 3, 2025, all New Hampshire DMV locations will move to an appointment-only system. Residents are encouraged to plan ahead as this shift is aimed at reducing wait times and creating a more efficient experience for everyone.\t\t\t\t NH DMV - Appointment Only. \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\nJaseya Ewing City Clerk and Tax Collector \nContact Us! \r\nContact the City Clerk's Office \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Clerk and Tax Collector Office \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 51 N. Park St. \n\t\t\t\t\t Lebanon ,  NH   03766 \r\nPhone:  603-448-3054 \r\nGeneral Hours \nMonday - Thursday \n7:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. \nClosed Fridays \nMarriage Licenses  \nMonday - Thursday \n8:00 a.m.- 4:00 p.m. \r\nMeet the Staff \n\t\t\t Agendas,  \nMinutes,  \nand Meetings \r\n\t\t\t Maps and Property \nInformation \r\n\t\t\t Forms, Permits, \nand Applications \r\n\t\t\t Ask LebNH or \nReport an Issue \r\n\t\t\t Subscribe to \nLebNews and \nLebAlerts \r\n\t\t\t Pay Your \nBill Online \r\nContact Us \r\nCity of Lebanon \r\nCity Hall \r\n51 N Park Street \r\nLebanon, NH 03766 \nCity Directory and Hours \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Ask LebNH \n         Pay Online \n         Sign Up for Alerts \n         View Employment Listings \n         City Homepage \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n         Social Media Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
